  "split-view": "changed elements between t and t+0.1s with the camera frozen (an element present in both frames counts only the region where its old and new boxes differ); violation when the union box of changes exceeds 60% of frame width or height for >= 1s, outside camera moves",
  "level1": "chart scenes of >= 2 s: exactly one visible .l1 (opacity > 0.5) in >= 50% of samples, never two",
